{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0155L7Rbp2MXrmvXXWTr2jv4","type":"tool_result","content":"diff --git a/README.md b/README.md\nindex c26890a..de324e9 100644\n--- a/README.md\n+++ b/README.md\n@@ -107,7 +107,9 @@ secrets/\n ├── bgg_api_key\n ├── imgproxy_key          # optional, see imgproxy section below\n ├── imgproxy_salt         # optional, see imgproxy section below\n-└── tmdb_access_token     # optional, see TMDB section below\n+├── tmdb_access_token     # optional, see TMDB section below\n+├── ntfy_topic            # optional, see ntfy below\n+└── ntfy_token            # optional, see ntfy below\n ```\n \n Each file should contain just the secret value, no trailing newline. Example:\n@@ -155,6 +157,8 @@ echo -n \"your-secret-value\" > secrets/db_password\n   - imgproxy keys (`imgproxy_key`, `imgproxy_salt`): if you want to use imgproxy for image processing instead of the default local processing. imgproxy is not required — solyto works out of the box without it. If you do want to use it, generate two 64-character hex strings (`openssl rand -hex 32`), write them to the secret files, and set `IMAGE_DRIVER=imgproxy` in `.env`.\n   \n   - TMDB Access Token (`tmdb_access_token`): if you want movie & series release notifications and trailers. Get a free Read Access Token from [themoviedb.org](https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api) after creating an account.\n+  \n+  - ntfy (`ntfy_topic`, `ntfy_token`): if you want admin notifications for your instance via [ntfy](https://ntfy.sh). Set `NTFY_URL` in `.env` to your ntfy server URL and write the topic to `secrets/ntfy_topic`. `ntfy_token` is only needed if your topic is protected. ntfy is off unless both `NTFY_URL` and `ntfy_topic` are set. There is no default server, so the instance makes no outbound calls to ntfy until you configure it.\n \n **4. Configure Dev Requests (optional)**\n \ndiff --git a/compose.yml b/compose.yml\nindex d1330bd..08611e5 100644\n--- a/compose.yml\n+++ b/compose.yml\n@@ -92,6 +92,8 @@ services:\n       TMDB_ACCESS_TOKEN_FILE: /run/secrets/tmdb_access_token\n       IMGPROXY_KEY_FILE: /run/secrets/imgproxy_key\n       IMGPROXY_SALT_FILE: /run/secrets/imgproxy_salt\n+      NTFY_TOPIC_FILE: /run/secrets/ntfy_topic\n+      NTFY_TOKEN_FILE: /run/secrets/ntfy_token\n     volumes:\n       - ./storage/:/var/www/storage/\n       - ./php/app.php.ini:/usr/local/etc/php/conf.d/solyto-php.ini:ro\n@@ -112,6 +114,8 @@ services:\n       - tmdb_access_token\n       - imgproxy_key\n       - imgproxy_salt\n+      - ntfy_topic\n+      - ntfy_token\n     restart: unless-stopped\n     networks:\n       - api\n@@ -180,6 +184,8 @@ services:\n       MAILGUN_SECRET_FILE: /run/secrets/mailgun_secret\n       IMGPROXY_KEY_FILE: /run/secrets/imgproxy_key\n       IMGPROXY_SALT_FILE: /run/secrets/imgproxy_salt\n+      NTFY_TOPIC_FILE: /run/secrets/ntfy_topic\n+      NTFY_TOKEN_FILE: /run/secrets/ntfy_token\n     volumes:\n       - ./storage/:/var/www/storage/\n       - ./php/queue.php.ini:/usr/local/etc/php/conf.d/solyto-php.ini:ro\n@@ -197,6 +203,8 @@ services:\n       - vapid_private_key\n       - imgproxy_key\n       - imgproxy_salt\n+      - ntfy_topic\n+      - ntfy_token\n     restart: unless-stopped\n     networks:\n       - api\n@@ -351,3 +359,7 @@ secrets:\n     file: ./secrets/imgproxy_key\n   imgproxy_salt:\n     file: ./secrets/imgproxy_salt\n+  ntfy_topic:\n+    file: ./secrets/ntfy_topic\n+  ntfy_token:\n+    file: ./secrets/ntfy_token\ndiff --git a/setup.sh b/setup.sh\nindex d69d2ce..66f9e50 100755\n--- a/setup.sh\n+++ b/setup.sh\n@@ -91,6 +91,8 @@ write_empty \"mailgun_secret\"\n write_empty \"vapid_public_key\"\n write_empty \"vapid_private_key\"\n write_empty \"bgg_api_key\"\n+write_empty \"ntfy_topic\"\n+write_empty \"ntfy_token\"\n \n echo \"\"\n echo \"Done. Run: cd solyto && docker compose up -d\"\n M .env\n M docs/jobs/around_ntfy-notifications-for-instance-admins/session.log\n M docs/jobs/around_ntfy-notifications-for-instance-admins/tokens.json\ncrw-rw-rw- 1 root root 1, 3 Oct  8 09:30 .env","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9eacb543-dd37-42d8-83e8-35267f1e12c8","uuid":"f2f84e25-a2ec-40d0-8bbb-9cad8f1024d4","timestamp":"2026-10-14T20:35:46.397Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"diff --git a/README.md b/README.md\nindex c26890a..de324e9 100644\n--- a/README.md\n+++ b/README.md\n@@ -107,7 +107,9 @@ secrets/\n ├── bgg_api_key\n ├── imgproxy_key          # optional, see imgproxy section below\n ├── imgproxy_salt         # optional, see imgproxy section below\n-└── tmdb_access_token     # optional, see TMDB section below\n+├── tmdb_access_token     # optional, see TMDB section below\n+├── ntfy_topic            # optional, see ntfy below\n+└── ntfy_token            # optional, see ntfy below\n ```\n \n Each file should contain just the secret value, no trailing newline. Example:\n@@ -155,6 +157,8 @@ echo -n \"your-secret-value\" > secrets/db_password\n   - imgproxy keys (`imgproxy_key`, `imgproxy_salt`): if you want to use imgproxy for image processing instead of the default local processing. imgproxy is not required — solyto works out of the box without it. If you do want to use it, generate two 64-character hex strings (`openssl rand -hex 32`), write them to the secret files, and set `IMAGE_DRIVER=imgproxy` in `.env`.\n   \n   - TMDB Access Token (`tmdb_access_token`): if you want movie & series release notifications and trailers. Get a free Read Access Token from [themoviedb.org](https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api) after creating an account.\n+  \n+  - ntfy (`ntfy_topic`, `ntfy_token`): if you want admin notifications for your instance via [ntfy](https://ntfy.sh). Set `NTFY_URL` in `.env` to your ntfy server URL and write the topic to `secrets/ntfy_topic`. `ntfy_token` is only needed if your topic is protected. ntfy is off unless both `NTFY_URL` and `ntfy_topic` are set. There is no default server, so the instance makes no outbound calls to ntfy until you c